-          Coming from Kira Studio, the old app's own update offer runs the same installer with
-          `--app=studio`: it installs Kira Space, then moves Kira Studio.app to the Trash. Your data
-          in `~/.kira-studio` folds into `~/.kira-space` on first launch (backup kept).
-          Config files move into `~/.kira-space/config/` (backup kept).
-
